    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just inhabiting a shell. like the person i was—the one who could fly, the one who had purpose—is just... gone. and this body that's left? it's just a heavy, broken thing that doesn't even feel like mine anymore. it's just taking up space.",
